lo","line":380},{"title":"@talgautb","target":"https://github.com/talgautb","line":380},{"title":"@tan75","target":"https://github.com/tan75","line":380},{"title":"Fixed Russian locale parsing issue","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1950","line":384},{"title":"Fixed `differenceInMonths` for edge cases, such as the end of February dates","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2185","line":386},{"title":"Fixed suffixes for the Kazakh locale","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2010","line":388},{"title":"Fixed `formatDuration` week translation in `pt` and `pt-BR` locales","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2125","line":390},{"title":"Made Japanese locale to use the correct value for the start of the week","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2099","line":392},{"title":"Adjusted date formats in the Basque locale","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2080","line":394},{"title":"Fixed the short and medium date formats in the Czech locale","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2111","line":396},{"title":"Adjusted the Polish translations of `formatDistance`","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2187","line":398},{"title":"Fixed the week's abbreviations in the Brazilian Portuguese","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2170","line":400},{"title":"Intl API","target":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Intl","line":404},{"title":"Added `intlFormat`","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2172","line":404},{"title":"Added `en-ZA` locale","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1952","line":406},{"title":"Added an ability to format lowercase am/pm with `aaa` and `bbb` tokens","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2016","line":408},{"title":"Added ordinal formatting for Japanese year values","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2177/files","line